{"4533070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Billion Citizens", "steam_appid": 4533070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billion Citizens is a rogue-like deck-building game with city-builder mechanics, where your goal is to design a city capable of housing 1 billion inhabitants.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/92960b351c8234bb345f0d301fe051e9.poster.avif?t=1781035650\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/92960b351c8234bb345f0d301fe051e9.webm?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/92960b351c8234bb345f0d301fe051e9.mp4?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your buildings, upgrade them, and combine them with your decrees to create powerful synergies. <br>Use the money generated by your buildings to customize your deck and manage your production to construct more and more structures. <br>You’ll need every possible optimization to reach the ultimate mandate, fend off political opponents, disasters, and an unhappy population to achieve victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/becba0870cc35d6f81fbce36fa172622.poster.avif?t=1781035650\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/becba0870cc35d6f81fbce36fa172622.webm?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/becba0870cc35d6f81fbce36fa172622.mp4?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city builder with a rogue-like twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine, upgrade, explore, and build the largest cities using bonuses and Decrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple terrains with new environments to experiment with endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Mayor, push the limits of your power: different starting conditions, unique Mayors, terrains, buildings, Decrees, and many hidden interactions to discover. <br>Take advantage of your versatile political arsenal to create overpowered combos, improve your deck, and grow your population.<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique decrees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 terrains with different generation properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Mayors with unique powers and starting conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 different building tiles to create numerous combos </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/361beb5a44db9b70eb68a580447be63b.poster.avif?t=1781035650\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/361beb5a44db9b70eb68a580447be63b.webm?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/361beb5a44db9b70eb68a580447be63b.mp4?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the wild and over-the-top world of Billion Citizens. Relax in this charming city builder offering thoughtful gameplay and a pleasant atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, discover new Mayors, terrains, and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is different and offers a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the soothing and delicate visuals of large cities and regions inspired by France.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billion Citizens is a rogue-like deck-building game with city-builder mechanics, where your goal is to design a city capable of housing 1 billion inhabitants.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/92960b351c8234bb345f0d301fe051e9.poster.avif?t=1781035650\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/92960b351c8234bb345f0d301fe051e9.webm?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/92960b351c8234bb345f0d301fe051e9.mp4?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your buildings, upgrade them, and combine them with your decrees to create powerful synergies. <br>Use the money generated by your buildings to customize your deck and manage your production to construct more and more structures. <br>You’ll need every possible optimization to reach the ultimate mandate, fend off political opponents, disasters, and an unhappy population to achieve victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/becba0870cc35d6f81fbce36fa172622.poster.avif?t=1781035650\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/becba0870cc35d6f81fbce36fa172622.webm?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/becba0870cc35d6f81fbce36fa172622.mp4?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city builder with a rogue-like twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine, upgrade, explore, and build the largest cities using bonuses and Decrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple terrains with new environments to experiment with endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Mayor, push the limits of your power: different starting conditions, unique Mayors, terrains, buildings, Decrees, and many hidden interactions to discover. <br>Take advantage of your versatile political arsenal to create overpowered combos, improve your deck, and grow your population.<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique decrees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 terrains with different generation properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Mayors with unique powers and starting conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 different building tiles to create numerous combos </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/361beb5a44db9b70eb68a580447be63b.poster.avif?t=1781035650\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/361beb5a44db9b70eb68a580447be63b.webm?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/extras/361beb5a44db9b70eb68a580447be63b.mp4?t=1781035650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the wild and over-the-top world of Billion Citizens. Relax in this charming city builder offering thoughtful gameplay and a pleasant atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, discover new Mayors, terrains, and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is different and offers a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the soothing and delicate visuals of large cities and regions inspired by France.</p>", "short_description": "Billion Citizens is a rogue-like deck-building game with city-builder mechanics where you play as a mayor planning how to create the greatest and most populous megalopolis of all times. Manage your deck of buildings and place them wisely to maximize their synergies.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/b7521a717b3c05ddb4730f2a09815574913c5073/header.jpg?t=1781035650", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/cede50e05caa55d788b53e5543078c97b1d91a95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781035650", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533070/cede50e05caa55d788b53e5543078c97b1d91a95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781035650", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8300H CPU @ 2.30GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sucre Discret"], "publishers": ["Sucre Discret"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62